<title>POLAND: Polifarb-W Q2 net rises to PLN 7.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Polifarb-W Q2 net rises to PLN 7.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polifarb Wroclaw preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    11.76   vs   11.04</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			11.69   vs   12.01</p>
<p>    net profit			     7.63   vs    7.54</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Polifarb Wroclaw SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     67.97   vs   65.54</p>
<p>    costs of sales			44.34   vs   44.79</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     3.58   vs    3.86</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.47   vs    0.61</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.68   vs    1.72</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.75   vs    0.75</p>
<p>    investment			     6.15   vs    3.87</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    17.78   vs   16.03</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			17.98   vs   17.48</p>
<p>    net profit			    11.60   vs   10.89</p>
<p>    net sales			    113.97   vs  103.73</p>
<p>    costs of sales			75.61   vs   71.69</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01   vs    0.05</p>
<p>    income tax			     5.75   vs    5.87</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.63   vs    0.71</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.10   vs    2.86</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.89   vs    1.36</p>
<p>    investment			    10.36   vs    4.54</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
